@startuml
title D2A — Surefyre Product Architecture
caption Forced horizontal layout inside the Surefyre platform

left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam wrapWidth 210
skinparam maxMessageSize 120
skinparam nodesep 85
skinparam ranksep 95
skinparam padding 18

skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 14
  BorderThickness 1.4
}
skinparam package {
  RoundCorner 16
  BorderThickness 1.8
}

actor "Retail Agent /\nAgency User" as Agent

package "SUREFYRE PLATFORM" as Surefyre #EAF4EA {
  together {
    rectangle "Agent Portal\n\n• New submissions\n• Document uploads\n• Validation feedback\n• Status and messages" as Portal #EAF2FF

    rectangle "Rules and Workflow Engine\n\n• Validation\n• Eligibility checks\n• Routing and queues\n• Referrals and tasks" as Rules #F3F8E8

    rectangle "Underwriting Workbench\n\n• Review and analyze\n• Request information\n• Quote / refer / bind\n• Decisioning and notes" as Workbench #EAF2FF
  }

  Portal -right-> Rules : 1. Validate
  Rules -right-> Workbench : 2. Route

  ' Force same-rank horizontal placement.
  Portal -[hidden]right-> Rules
  Rules -[hidden]right-> Workbench
}

rectangle "AIM\n\nCore insurance operations\nand transaction data" as AIM #FFF1DF
rectangle "ImageRight\n\nDocuments and\nworkflow references" as ImageRight #FFF1DF
rectangle "Carrier / Rating /\nThird-Party Services\n\nRates, policy services\nand enrichment" as External #FFF1DF

Agent -right-> Portal : New submission,\ndocuments and messages

Workbench -right-> AIM : Transaction and\npolicy data
Workbench -right-> ImageRight : Document metadata\nand requests
Workbench -right-> External : Rating or\npolicy request

AIM -[dashed]left-> Workbench : Status and results
ImageRight -[dashed]left-> Workbench : Document IDs\nand status
External -[dashed]left-> Workbench : Response,\ndecision or data

Workbench -[dashed]left-> Portal : Status, requests,\nquote and documents
Portal -[dashed]left-> Agent : User-facing response

AIM -[hidden]down-> ImageRight
ImageRight -[hidden]down-> External

legend bottom
|= Component |= Primary purpose |
| Agent Portal | External submission and communication |
| Rules and Workflow Engine | Validation, eligibility, routing and tasks |
| Underwriting Workbench | Internal review, quoting and decisions |
| AIM | Core insurance operations and transaction processing |
| ImageRight | Document and workflow management |
| External Services | Rating, policy and third-party integrations |
endlegend

note bottom of Surefyre
Simplified interview model.
Exact system-of-record ownership and integration direction
should be confirmed with SPG.
end note

@enduml
